<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CreativeChronicle - Article Details</title>
    <!-- Bootstrap 5 CDN -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        /* ==========================================================================
           VÙNG 1: AUTHOR INFO (FLEXBOX 1D)
           ========================================================================== */
        .author-section {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6;
        }

        .author-avatar {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #0d6efd;
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* ==========================================================================
           VÙNG 2: MOSAIC GALLERY (CSS GRID 2D)
           ========================================================================== */
        .mosaic-gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            grid-template-rows: 200px 200px;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .photo-card {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .photo-main {
            grid-row: span 2;
            background-color: #ff6b6b;
        }

        .photo-sub-1 {
            background-color: #4ecdc4;
        }

        .photo-sub-2 {
            background-color: #45b7d1;
        }

        /* Responsive Breakpoint cho Mosaic Gallery (Mobile < 768px) */
        @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
            .mosaic-gallery {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                grid-template-rows: auto;
            }

            .photo-main {
                grid-row: span 1;
                height: 250px;
            }

            .photo-sub-1, .photo-sub-2 {
                height: 180px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-light">

    <div class="container my-5 bg-white p-4 p-md-5 rounded shadow-sm">

        <!-- VÙNG 1: AUTHOR META-INFO (Ứng dụng Flexbox & Bootstrap Utilities) -->
        <div class="author-section d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3 pb-3 mb-4">
            <!-- Cụm bên trái: Avatar + Tên tác giả -->
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                <div class="author-avatar">JD</div>
                <div>
                    <h5 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Jane Doe</h5>
                    <small class="text-muted">Published on Oct 25, 2026</small>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Cụm bên phải: Nút Chia sẻ -->
            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                <button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">Share Facebook</button>
                <button class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm">Tweet</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- VÙNG 2: MOSAIC GALLERY (Ứng dụng CSS Grid) -->
        <div class="mosaic-gallery">
            <div class="photo-card photo-main">Main Photo</div>
            <div class="photo-card photo-sub-1">Sub Photo 1</div>
            <div class="photo-card photo-sub-2">Sub Photo 2</div>
        </div>

        <!-- NỘI DUNG BÀI BÁO (Không còn lo bị Gallery đè đè lớp) -->
        <article class="mb-5">
            <p class="lead">
                Đây là nội dung bài báo. Nhờ chuyển sang CSS Grid, khối Mosaic Gallery luôn có chiều cao thực tế tự động tính toán. Khi thu nhỏ màn hình về điện thoại, các phần tử xếp chồng an toàn mà hoàn toàn không đè lên đoạn văn bản này.
            </p>
        </article>

        <!-- VÙNG 3: RECOMMENDED ARTICLES (Ứng dụng Bootstrap Grid System) -->
        <section class="recommended-section">
            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-4 border-start border-4 border-primary ps-3">Recommended Articles</h3>
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
                        <div class="card-body bg-light rounded">
                            <span class="badge bg-primary mb-2">Art</span>
                            <h5 class="card-title h6 fw-bold">Article 1</h5>
                            <p class="card-text small text-muted">Exploring modernism in 2026 digital spaces.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
                        <div class="card-body bg-light rounded">
                            <span class="badge bg-secondary mb-2">Design</span>
                            <h5 class="card-title h6 fw-bold">Article 2</h5>
                            <p class="card-text small text-muted">The evolution of responsive layouts.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
                        <div class="card-body bg-light rounded">
                            <span class="badge bg-success mb-2">Culture</span>
                            <h5 class="card-title h6 fw-bold">Article 3</h5>
                            <p class="card-text small text-muted">Exhibitions you should not miss this autumn.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
                        <div class="card-body bg-light rounded">
                            <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark mb-2">Opinion</span>
                            <h5 class="card-title h6 fw-bold">Article 4</h5>
                            <p class="card-text small text-muted">Is AI reshaping creative direction?</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
